From 4ff5538dc11f7c6d15e1f8d1f1343034d2d06ce9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: RobPruzan <rapruzan@buffalo.edu>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 12:16:14 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] pixel: WebView lazy, pauseOffscreen, passWheel,
 onContentHeight, focus/hover callbacks; Box onViewport

Ported from the old pixel's inline-HTML work (4df492a, c2e0004, 1a47764), minus
PageText, shared renderer processes and the zoom prop: the engine reports when a
box nears its scroll area's view, pages freeze while away and load only when near,
the wheel passes through an unfocused page, focus is taken on press only, and the
page's content height is reported.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
